# Google Drive sync (OAuth via GIS token model) — optional.
# Create an OAuth 2.0 "Web application" client in Google Cloud Console with the
# Drive API enabled and scope `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.appdata`.
# Authorized JavaScript origins: your app origin (e.g. http://localhost:5173)
# No client secret or redirect URI needed — GIS token model returns the access
# token directly to the browser.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
